  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO Building Palestinian Resilience by improving mental well-being and strengthening Mental Health and Psychosocial Serv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To scale-up community mental health services by strengthening community rehabilitation program and improving the quality of services for vulnerable groups 2. To support the MoH and UNRWA to integrate delivery of evidence-based interventions for priority mental conditions in primary health care and general hospitals supported by a referral system 3. To strengthen school mental health care for adolescents with risky behaviours for both UNRWA and MoE in oPt</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote the mental well-being of the Palestinian people by strengthening a comprehensive, integrated, and inclusive mental health services accessible to all Palestinians in the West Bank (including East Jerusalem) and Gaza.1. &#xCDE8;&#xC57D;&#xACC4;&#xCE35;(&#xC544;&#xB3D9;, &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;, &#xD3ED;&#xB825; &#xD53C;&#xD574;&#xC5EC;&#xC131;, &#xB178;&#xC778;, &#xB09C;&#xBBFC;)&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C; &#xC815;&#xC2E0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15;&#xC13C;&#xD130;(CMHC)&#xC758; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xD488;&#xC9C8; &#xAC1C;&#xC120; 2. 1&#xCC28; &#xC758;&#xB8CC; &#xBC0F; &#xC885;&#xD569;&#xBCD1;&#xC6D0;&#xC5D0;&#xC11C;&#xC758; &#xC815;&#xC2E0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15; &#xC9C4;&#xB8CC; &#xAD00;&#xD55C; &#xC99D;&#xAC70;&#xAE30;&#xBC18; &#xAC1C;&#xC785; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0; 3. &#xC704;&#xD5D8; &#xD589;&#xB3D9; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xC815;&#xC2E0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC; &#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
  </description>
